---
interface Props { id?: string }
const { id = "why-trust-us" } = Astro.props;
---
<section aria-labelledby={id} class="my-12 rounded-2xl bg-wash p-6 sm:p-8">
  <h2 id={id} class="text-[1.45rem] font-extrabold tracking-tight text-ink">Why you can trust this list</h2>
  <div class="mt-4 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-3">
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">We check the claims</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] leading-7 text-ink-2">Every feature, price note and encryption claim is checked against the developer's own site, store listing and privacy policy.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">Same checklist for every app</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] leading-7 text-ink-2">Each app is scored against the same nine-point privacy checklist, so you can compare like with like.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <p class="font-semibold text-ink">No paid placements</p>
      <p class="mt-1 text-[0.95rem] leading-7 text-ink-2">Developers can't buy a spot or a better rank. If we ever earn a commission, it never changes the order.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <p class="mt-5 text-sm text-ink-3">Read the full <a href="/how-we-review/" class="link">review methodology</a> and our <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/" class="link">disclosure</a>. Spotted something out of date? <a href="/contact/" class="link">Tell us</a>.</p>
</section>
